{{!
    @template mod_webcoached/embedded

    Template embedding the Webcoached SSO launch in an iframe on the activity page.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data providers required for this template:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name string The instance name.
    * intro string The activity introduction/description.
    * launchurl string URL of view.php with launch=1, loaded inside the iframe.
    * height int Height of the iframe in pixels.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Webcoached Training Course",
        "intro": "<p>Welcome to the Webcoached training module.</p>",
        "launchurl": "http://localhost/mod/webcoached/view.php?id=1&launch=1",
        "height": 800
    }
}}
<div class="mod_webcoached_embedded my-4">
    {{#intro}}
        <div class="mb-3 text-muted">{{{intro}}}</div>
    {{/intro}}
    <iframe src="{{{launchurl}}}" title="{{name}}" class="w-100 border rounded"
        style="height: {{height}}px;" allow="fullscreen"></iframe>
</div>
